\\!\\(\\*StyleBox[\\\"expr\\\", \\\"TI\\\"]\\) with functions determined by a \
numerical solution to the ordinary differential equations \
\\!\\(\\*StyleBox[\\\"eqns\\\", \\\"TI\\\"]\\) with the independent variable \
\\!\\(\\*StyleBox[\\\"x\\\", \\\"TI\\\"]\\) in the range \
\\!\\(\\*SubscriptBox[StyleBox[\\\"x\\\", \\\"TI\\\"], StyleBox[\\\"min\\\", \
\\\"TI\\\"]]\\) to \\!\\(\\*SubscriptBox[StyleBox[\\\"x\\\", \\\"TI\\\"], \
