\\\",\\\", StyleBox[\\\"y\\\", \\\"TI\\\"]}], \\\"}\\\"}], StyleBox[\\\"\
\[Element]\\\", \\\"TR\\\"], StyleBox[\\\"\[CapitalOmega]\\\", \
\\\"TR\\\"]}]}], \\\"]\\\"}]\\) solves the time-dependent partial \
differential equations \\!\\(\\*StyleBox[\\\"eqns\\\", \\\"TI\\\"]\\) over \
